# Butler Routes - Hillsbrad rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Hillsbrad Foothills. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none
# are stated. Four higher-level rares (Narillasanz, Old Cliff Jumper, Araga,
# Lady Zephris) live above the zone band and are not covered here. No rare in
# this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest. See
# docs/hillsbrad-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/hillsbrad-rares
title Hillsbrad Foothills - Rares & Treasures
levels 20-32
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords hillsbrad, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Dalaran Spellscribe — the far west

  goto 8.9,23.8
  kill 1920 optional
  collect 4436 "Jewel-encrusted Sash" optional
  collect 4437 "Channeler's Staff" optional
  note Level 21 rare caster, flagged rare in the data, out by the Dalaran crater.
  note The sash and staff drop nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Tamra Stormpike — the southeastern hills

  loop
  goto 70.68,78.05
  goto 72.31,82.34
  goto 73.25,81.09
  kill 14275 optional
  collect 282710 "Dun Garok Rifle" optional
  note Level 28 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The rifle drops nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Scargil — the southwest shore

  goto 29.08,73.56
  kill 14276 optional
  collect 282716 "Imbued Scaled Cuffs" optional
  note Level 30 rare murloc, flagged rare in the data; not tameable.
  note The cuffs drop nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ro'Bark — the eastern gnolls

  goto 65.72,60.15
  kill 14278 optional
  collect 282721 "Gnoll Shaman's Staff" optional
  note Level 28 rare gnoll, flagged rare in the data; not tameable.
  note The staff drops nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Creepthess — the western fields

  goto 38.6,58.37
  kill 14279 optional
  collect 282720 "Spider Swarm" optional
  note Level 24 rare spider, flagged rare in the data. Drops spider meat and silk.
  note The swarm drops nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Big Samras — the Dun Garok approach

  goto 86.03,39.93
  kill 14280 optional
  collect 282717 "Durable Bearhide Pauldrons" optional
  note Level 27 rare bear, flagged rare in the data, on the far-eastern approach to Dun Garok. Drops bear meat.
  note The pauldrons drop nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jimmy the Bleeder — the northern hills

  goto 60.1,9.1
  kill 14281 optional
  collect 282713 "Bloodstained Pants" optional
  note Level 23 rare, flagged rare in the data, up in the northern hills.
  note The pants drop nowhere else; also shares the generic world-drop table. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

