  note Seven Hidden Strongbox placements in the far west, eighteen Solid Chest placements across the zone, thirty-three Barrel of Melon Juice and forty-four Food Crate placements, five Barrel of Milk placements, twenty-six Alliance Chest placements, four Alliance Strongbox placements, one Ambermill Strongbox, eighteen Battered Footlocker placements at the Syndicate camp, two Camp Crates and one Unopened Crate. All hold ordinary low-level goods; no unique treasure confirmed.
  note No contract quest takes an object objective from any of these containers. Respawn timers unconfirmed.
